    "title": "📑 Session 47 — Chapter 9. Qualitative Methods with support of Gen-AI tools (feedback, information generation, sources)|||📑 Buổi 47 — Chapter 9. Qualitative Methods with support of Gen-AI tools (feedback, information generation, sources)",
