    "slug": "elr301-flm-thi-5",
    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Proposal Defense 30.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELR301 · Assessment 5/5</span>\n<h2>Proposal Defense</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13754 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELR301 · Đầu điểm 5/5</span>\n<h2>Proposal Defense</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13754 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">Final exam</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">15' per student</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">All LOs</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Presentation</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Test student's ability to apply knowledge and techniques obtained in the delivered units to compose a research proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Individual presentation - defense of the proposal<br>One examiner. Marking rubric and report are provided.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
