    "slug": "elr301-flm-tl-link",
    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Link học thêm gom từ syllabus, slide và tài liệu.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELR301 · Further study</span>\n<h2>Links for further study</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Collected automatically from the syllabus, the slides and the material pack. Some may have moved since the university published them.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELR301 · Học thêm</span>\n<h2>Link học thêm</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Gom tự động từ syllabus, slide và gói tài liệu. Một số link có thể đã đổi chỗ kể từ khi trường công bố.</p></div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://edge.sagepub.com/creswellrd5e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://edge.sagepub.com/creswellrd5e</a> <small>— giáo trình, tài liệu Online.doc, tài liệu Quarter.doc…</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://library.books24x7.com/toc.aspx?bookid=42741\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://library.books24x7.com/toc.aspx?bookid=42741</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Utilizing-Tools-Academic-Research-Writing/dp/B0CPPYWSSM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.amazon.com/Utilizing-Tools-Academic-Research-Writing/dp/B0CPPYWSSM</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://research-and-innovation.ec.europa.eu/document/download/2b6cf7e5-36ac-41cb-aab5-0d32050143dc_en?filename=ec_rtd_ai-guidelines.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://research-and-innovation.ec.europa.eu/document/download/2b6cf7e5-36ac-41cb-aab5-0d32050143dc_en?filename=ec_rtd_…</a> <small>— kế hoạch buổi</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tesl-ej.org/wordpress/issues/volume28/ej112/ej112int/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://tesl-ej.org/wordpress/issues/volume28/ej112/ej112int/</a> <small>— kế hoạch buổi</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://shorturl.at/mPQGU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://shorturl.at/mPQGU</a> <small>— slide SPSS Training, tài liệu SPSS Training.pptx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.4324/9781003149347\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://doi.org/10.4324/9781003149347</a> <small>— slide SPSS Training, tài liệu SPSS Training.pptx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://behrend.psu.edu/research-outreach/student-research/undergrad-research-grants/scoring-rubric-undergraduate-research\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://behrend.psu.edu/research-outreach/student-research/undergrad-research-grants/scoring-rubric-undergraduate-resea…</a> <small>— tài liệu ELR301_Rubrics.xlsx</small></li>\n</ul>"
